message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits (see "Releasing" in the contributing guide).
title: Cloud Registry UI
abstract: >-
  Cloud Registry UI is the web front end of Cloud Registry, a registry of web
  services that implements the GA4GH Service Registry API: anyone can browse
  the registered services and their types; users who log in with an OpenID
  Connect provider can register and manage services, share them with others,
  and add service types, and admins can verify services and approve types.
type: software
